  48:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h **** /** \brief    Selection of MTDIV max divisor and result width.
  49:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h ****  *
  50:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h ****  *  \note     By default the MTDIV width is 32-bit, but can be reduced to 
  51:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h ****  *            16-bit to save memory by defining MTDIV_WIDTH_16 if 32-bit
ARM GAS  C:\Users\SX2605~1.HOD\AppData\Local\Temp\ccPwWU88.s 			page 6


  52:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h ****  *            division is not used.
